<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>你的中文名 · Chinese Name</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #faf8f4;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 18px 24px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e2d7;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .brand {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .brand span { color: #b83a2a; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 10px 22px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: #b83a2a;
      color: #fff;
    }
    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 72px 24px 48px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 40px;
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .hero h1 strong { color: #b83a2a; }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #5a5247;
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto 32px;
    }
    .input-box {
      max-width: 480px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .input-box input {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      font-size: 16px;
      border: 2px solid #e8e2d7;
      border-radius: 12px;
      outline: none;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .card {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 48px auto;
      padding: 32px;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #e8e2d7;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
    }
    .card-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .name-en {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #8a7f72;
    }
    .name-cn {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .name-cn span { margin-right: 10px; }
    .score {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #b83a2a;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .chars {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .char-item {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 160px;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #faf8f4;
      border: 1px solid #e8e2d7;
    }
    .char-item h3 {
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      color: #b83a2a;
    }
    .char-item p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #5a5247;
    }
    .section {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 48px 24px;
    }
    .section h2 {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .section p {
      color: #5a5247;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }
    .step {
      padding: 22px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e8e2d7;
    }
    .step .num {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #b83a2a;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .step h3 { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .step p { font-size: 14px; color: #5a5247; margin: 0; }
    .footer-cta {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 64px 24px;
    }
    .footer-cta .btn {
      font-size: 18px;
      padding: 16px 32px;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #8a7f72;
      border-top: 1px solid #e8e2d7;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="brand">名 · <span>Chinese Identity</span></div>
  <a href=" " class="btn btn-primary">创建你的中文名</a >
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <h1>你的英文名，也可以有一个<br><strong>好听又自然的中文名</strong></h1>
  <p>输入你的英文名，我们会根据发音、寓意和中文姓名习惯，为你生成一个像真名一样的中文名字。</p >
  <div class="input-box">
    <input type="text" placeholder="例如：Sarah" />
    <button class="btn btn-primary">生成中文名</button>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="card">
  <div class="card-header">
    <div>
      <div class="name-en">Sarah · 萨拉</div>
      <div class="name-cn"><span>苏</span><span>婉</span><span>宁</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="score">自然度评分 96</div>
  </div>
  <p style="font-size:14px;color:#5a5247;">这个名字听起来像真实中文姓名，姓氏自然，发音贴近，寓意温柔安宁。</p >
  <div class="chars">
    <div class="char-item">
      <h3>苏</h3>
      <p>姓氏 · 常见中文姓氏，发音自然，适合作为中文姓。</p >
    </div>
    <div class="char-item">
      <h3>婉</h3>
      <p>寓意 · 温柔、优雅、婉约，适合女性名字。</p >
    </div>
    <div class="char-item">
      <h3>宁</h3>
      <p>寓意 · 安宁、平静、从容，带有平和气质。</p >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>它是如何工作的？</h2>
  <p>从英文名到中文名，只需要三步。</p >
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step">
      <div class="num">步骤 1</div>
      <h3>输入英文名</h3>
      <p>填写你的英文名、性别和喜欢的风格。</p >
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="num">步骤 2</div>
      <h3>生成中文名</h3>
      <p>系统会结合发音、寓意和姓名习惯生成名字。</p >
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="num">步骤 3</div>
      <h3>查看解析</h3>
      <p>每个字都会解释含义、发音和适合人群。</p >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>中文名自然度评分</h2>
  <p>我们会从姓氏、发音、寓意三个维度判断一个中文名是否自然。</p >
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step">
      <h3>姓 · 自然</h3>
      <p>使用真实常见中文姓氏，避免生硬拼接。</p >
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <h3>音 · 贴近</h3>
      <p>尽量保留英文名的发音线索，读起来顺口。</p >
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <h3>意 · 美好</h3>
      <p>每个字都有积极寓意，符合中文审美。</p >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="footer-cta">
  <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">你的中文名字 · 立即创建</a >
</section>

<footer>
  © 2026 Chinese Identity · 中文名生成
</footer>

</body>
</html>
